<p>Your touch carries an entropic curse, marking your victims for a terrible fate. Each time you deal damage to a target, they are Jinxed for 5 turns. This stacks up to 10 times, reducing saves and defense by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5">1.00, 2.00, 2.00, 3.00, 3.00</acronym> and critical strike chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5">1.00%, 1.00%, 1.50%, 1.50%, 2.00%.</acronym></p><p>This can only be applied once per target per turn and will fade entirely if you break line of sight with your target for more than 2 turns.</p>